      "note": "Re-measured 2026-08-28 on published `@markup-carve/carve` 0.1.5: the doubled family is now IN the release (`==>` renders U+21D2), and `=>` stopped converting in the same release. The row's ASCII spellings still render, so it stands; references/traps-blocks-containers.md 12 carries the measurement and `doubled_arrows` in references/capabilities.json now probes it, which is what this note used to be doing by hand."
